  "requiredSecurityProperties": [
    "every table has row level security enabled and forced",
    "PUBLIC has no schema function table sequence or view capability",
    "anonymous and authenticated convenience roles receive no LOR grants",
    "students are confined to their exact active WordPress subject and bound JWT UUID",
    "student writes additionally require trusted transaction local entitlement feature enablement and canary authorization",
    "student projections omit faculty private data raw invitation material private object locators and unreleased letter text",
    "released student content is bound to an immutable current nonwaived release snapshot",
    "faculty access requires the exact consumed recipient bound unexpired unrevoked invitation and OTP proof for the case",
    "mentor access requires an exact active unrevoked case assignment and never includes faculty private content",
    "administrator founder support and service roles require an exact active case grant and role alone grants nothing",
    "all mutable state writes enforce exact optimistic revisions and same transaction audit and replay truth",
    "student safe state is physically separated from protected faculty strategy and version history state with a hash bound append only revision ledger",
    "append only ledgers reject update and delete",
    "audit rows use the closed metadata event vocabulary and never store letter story evidence prompt token email signature or private content",
    "migration and rollback are executable only in the validated disposable synthetic local PostgreSQL harness until Founder Gate A"
  ]
}
